1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Policy says deny. Behavior says allow.
The difference is the evidence.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
One boundary. Three distinct realities.
Intended permission, independent policy and observed behavior stay distinct.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
A failed control never becomes a pass.
Blocked negative checks remain inconclusive. No request is sent.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Same contract. 2 boundaries fixed.
The local fixture changes. Its authorization expectations stay unchanged.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Every run has a history.
Retain the contract, graph and evidence. Prepare a controlled retest.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Sign the evidence. Verify independently.
Ed25519. Exact inventory. A public key trusted outside the package.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Evidence decides. AI only advises.
Deterministic findings remain authoritative. Optional local AI never changes outcomes.

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Authorization Intelligence, built on evidence.
Know who can do what. Prove what changed.
